&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Content Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duetto &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; Remote-first, United Kingdom / Spain&amp;nbsp; |&amp;nbsp; Reports to VP, Growth Marketing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a bold brand voice, a growing library of campaigns, and a product story worth telling — what we need is someone who can help bring all of it to life, day in and day out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on content role for a versatile writer who&#39;s looking to build their craft across formats: one day you&#39;re writing campaign copy for a demand gen push, the next you&#39;re drafting a social series, the next you&#39;re turning a product update into content people actually want to engage with. You&#39;ll work from clear briefs and direction, with support from senior content and marketing colleagues, and your job is to turn that direction into content that ships — quickly and well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a role about setting content strategy — that sits elsewhere in the team. It&#39;s about strong, reliable execution: taking a brief and producing content that&#39;s on-brand and ready to go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re a solid writer looking to grow across formats and channels, who takes direction well and enjoys the craft of making content land — this is a great next step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll work on&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand and campaign content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help produce content that supports our demand gen campaigns, brand-building efforts, and always-on content calendar — blogs, guides, social copy, email, sales enablement material, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply our brand voice consistently across everything you touch — punchy, smart, and customer-focused&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from briefs set by senior colleagues, asking good questions to make sure the output lands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help turn product updates and feature releases into content that goes beyond the feature list — finding the customer angle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the product marketing team to stay close to what&#39;s shipping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support launch communications and update announcements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Social-first content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think social-first on what you make — considering platform, format, and hook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support experimentation with format and style — short-form video, carousels, text posts, customer spotlights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Video and content production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help brief video agencies and creative resources, under guidance from senior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with design and creative to help produce on-brand content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support individual pieces of content from concept through to publish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-enabled content production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Duetto&#39;s AI-enabled content tools to help produce content at pace, without compromising quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to speed up drafting, iteration, and adaptation of content across formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-generated content&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help spot and support opportunities to activate customers as content creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the customer marketing function to help surface and share UGC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to a growing library of customer voices and product proof points&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel and surface coverage&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help adapt content for the right surface — social, in-app, customer newsletters, website, sales enablement, partner comms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the broader content and growth teams to keep content calendars full&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain a steady content cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years in a content marketing, copywriting, or brand content role, with a portfolio that shows range across formats and channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with both campaign/brand content and product-related content is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable supporting work with external creative or video resources, under direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in B2B SaaS is a plus, but strong writing and a willingness to learn matter more than sector experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong writer — able to take a brief and turn it into content that&#39;s clear and on-brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social-first instincts — you naturally think about platform, format, and hook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organised and reliable — you can manage a few pieces of content at once and hit deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good at taking direction — you don&#39;t need a strategy explained in detail to run with a brief, but you&#39;re not expected to set the strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and eager to grow your craft across formats and channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you operate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re a maker — your output is content, not decks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re genuinely curious about the product, the brand, and the industry you&#39;re writing about&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with ambiguity and change — priorities move, and you adapt without losing momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable using AI as part of how you work, and keen to get better at it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like in year one&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consistent, reliable output of content across campaigns, brand, and product moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content that&#39;s dependable, on-brand, and ready to use across sales, customer success, and partner teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve grown your range across formats and become a trusted pair of hands for the wider marketing team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Duetto&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duetto delivers a suite of SaaS cloud-native applications for hospitality businesses to optimize every booking opportunity for greater revenue impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Revenue &amp;amp; Profit Operating System brings together pricing, forecasting, reporting, group optimization, and profitability in one platform — helping the world&#39;s most innovative hotels move faster, think smarter, and grow stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more, visit duettocloud.com&lt;/p&gt;
